Article 33

1. Fulfillment of children's rights shall be implemented in an integrated and systematic manner from all sectors on an ongoing basis through CFC development policies.

15­ {2) CFC development policies as referred to in paragraph (1) shall contain:
a. CFC concept;
b. children's rights; andc. CFC development approach.
3. CFC development policies as referred to in paragraph (1) shall be directed at the fulfillment of children's rights, including: a. civil rights and freedoms;
